<title>UK: BSkyB down on worries about German venture.</title>
<headline>BSkyB down on worries about German venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Sky Broadcasting Corp. Plc dropped on Wednesday after a report in the Financial Times raised concerns about its planned venture with German pay-TV network Premiere.</p>
<p>The stock, which reached a record 597 on August 27, was down 11p at 565-1/2 by 0930 GMT.</p>
